OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA sunny start for most, with
OL,6,Fsome patchy cloud around, before
OL,7,Fthicker cloud spreads south through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Likely dry, but very
OL,9,Fisolated showers possible later. Very
OL,10,Fwarm again, but breezier.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud clearing for a time
OL,13,Fbefore further cloud pushes in from
OL,14,Fthe west overnight. This will bring
OL,15,Fsome light outbreaks of rain. Much
OL,16,Fbreezier by the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
