OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA cooler day to come on Sunday
OL,6,Fwith a mix of sunny spells and
OL,7,Fshowers, these may turn heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Often rather breezy, if not
OL,9,Fwindy around exposed areas.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,12,Fdry into the new week with spells of
OL,13,Fsunshine. Temperatures gradually
OL,14,Fincreasing again, day by day, with
OL,15,Fanother hotter spell to come.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
